---
title: Data Persistence Cycle - K1 to K0 to WAL and Back
description: End-to-end data flow for command submission, persistence, retrieval, and signature verification
authors: [K1 Intelligence Team]
version: 1.0.0
date: 2025-10-26
tags: [k1, layer5, persistence, wal, receipts, idempotency, signatures]
related_adrs: [ADR-0001a, ADR-0015, ADR-0024, ADR-0044]
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as K1 Agent<br/>(L3 Execution)
    participant CMD as K0CommandClient<br/>(L5 Bridge)
    participant QRY as K0QueryClient<br/>(L5 Bridge)
    participant K0_CMD as K0 Command Port<br/>(:8080/k0/command.submit)
    participant K0_QRY as K0 Query Port<br/>(:8080/k0/query.recall)
    participant WAL as SQLite WAL<br/>(k0_kernel.db)
    participant IDX as Receipt Index<br/>(SHA256 → Position)
    participant SIG as Signature Verifier<br/>(Ed25519)
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Phase 1: Command Submission with Receipt
    
    Agent->>Agent: Create CommandEnvelope<br/>{agent_id, command_type, payload, band=GREEN}
    Agent->>CMD: submit_command(envelope, receipts=True, idempotency=True)
    activate CMD
    
    CMD->>CMD: Compute SHA256 receipt<br/>hash = SHA256(envelope_bytes)
    CMD->>CMD: Store receipt locally<br/>pending_receipts[hash] = envelope
    
    CMD->>K0_CMD: POST /k0/command.submit<br/>Headers: X-Receipt-Expected: true<br/>Body: CommandEnvelope
    activate K0_CMD
    
    K0_CMD->>K0_CMD: Validate schema (k1.contracts.envelope.schema.yaml)
    K0_CMD->>K0_CMD: Compute SHA256 receipt (server-side)
    
    K0_CMD->>IDX: Check duplicate receipt
    activate IDX
    IDX->>IDX: Lookup hash in index
    
    alt Receipt exists (duplicate)
        IDX-->>K0_CMD: Found at position 85
        K0_CMD-->>CMD: 409 Conflict<br/>{error: "Duplicate receipt", position: 85}
        CMD->>CMD: Validate idempotency (expected behavior)
        CMD-->>Agent: CommandReceipt (existing position=85)
    else Receipt not found (new)
        IDX-->>K0_CMD: Not found (proceed)
        deactivate IDX
        
        K0_CMD->>WAL: BEGIN IMMEDIATE TRANSACTION
        activate WAL
        
        WAL->>WAL: Append envelope to WAL<br/>position: 87 → 88<br/>timestamp: 2025-10-26T10:05:30Z
        
        WAL->>IDX: Store receipt mapping<br/>SHA256(envelope) → position 88
        activate IDX
        IDX->>IDX: Insert into receipt_index table
        deactivate IDX
        
        WAL->>WAL: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        
        WAL-->>K0_CMD: Success (position=88, lag=0ms)
        deactivate WAL
        
        K0_CMD-->>CMD: 200 OK<br/>CommandReceipt {<br/>  receipt: "sha256:abc123...",<br/>  position: 88,<br/>  lag_ms: 0<br/>}
        deactivate K0_CMD
        
        CMD->>CMD: Validate receipt matches local SHA256
        CMD->>CMD: Clear pending receipt<br/>del pending_receipts[hash]
        
        CMD-->>Agent: CommandReceipt (position=88)
        deactivate CMD
    end
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Phase 2: Query Retrieval with Position
    
    Agent->>QRY: recall_state(position=88, verify_signature=True)
    activate QRY
    
    QRY->>K0_QRY: POST /k0/query.recall<br/>Body: {position: 88, include_signature: true}
    activate K0_QRY
    
    K0_QRY->>WAL: SELECT * FROM wal WHERE position = 88
    activate WAL
    
    WAL->>WAL: Read envelope from WAL<br/>position 88
    WAL-->>K0_QRY: Envelope + metadata<br/>{envelope, timestamp, signature}
    deactivate WAL
    
    K0_QRY->>SIG: Verify Ed25519 signature
    activate SIG
    SIG->>SIG: public_key.verify(envelope_bytes, signature)
    
    alt Signature valid
        SIG-->>K0_QRY: Verified (authentic)
        K0_QRY-->>QRY: 200 OK<br/>QueryResult {<br/>  envelope,<br/>  position: 88,<br/>  timestamp,<br/>  signature,<br/>  verified: true<br/>}
    else Signature invalid
        SIG-->>K0_QRY: Verification failed
        K0_QRY-->>QRY: 200 OK<br/>QueryResult {verified: false}
    end
    deactivate SIG
    deactivate K0_QRY
    
    QRY->>QRY: Cache result locally<br/>lru_cache[88] = envelope
    QRY-->>Agent: QueryResult (verified envelope)
    deactivate QRY
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Phase 3: Idempotency Check (Resubmit Same Command)
    
    Agent->>CMD: submit_command(same_envelope, receipts=True, idempotency=True)
    activate CMD
    
    CMD->>CMD: Compute SHA256 receipt<br/>hash = SHA256(envelope_bytes)<br/>Result: Same hash as before
    
    CMD->>K0_CMD: POST /k0/command.submit<br/>Body: CommandEnvelope
    activate K0_CMD
    
    K0_CMD->>IDX: Check duplicate receipt
    activate IDX
    IDX->>IDX: Lookup hash in index
    IDX-->>K0_CMD: Found at position 88
    deactivate IDX
    
    K0_CMD-->>CMD: 409 Conflict<br/>{error: "Duplicate receipt", original_position: 88}
    deactivate K0_CMD
    
    CMD->>CMD: Idempotency satisfied (expected 409)
    CMD-->>Agent: CommandReceipt (position=88, idempotent=True)
    deactivate CMD
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Phase 4: Range Query (Multiple Positions)
    
    Agent->>QRY: recall_range(start=85, end=90)
    activate QRY
    
    QRY->>K0_QRY: POST /k0/query.recall<br/>Body: {start: 85, end: 90}
    activate K0_QRY
    
    K0_QRY->>WAL: SELECT * FROM wal WHERE position >= 85 AND position <= 90
    activate WAL
    
    WAL->>WAL: Read 6 envelopes<br/>Positions: 85, 86, 87, 88, 89, 90
    WAL-->>K0_QRY: List[Envelope] (6 items)
    deactivate WAL
    
    K0_QRY-->>QRY: 200 OK<br/>QueryRangeResult {<br/>  envelopes: [85...90],<br/>  count: 6<br/>}
    deactivate K0_QRY
    
    QRY-->>Agent: List[QueryResult] (6 items)
    deactivate QRY
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Phase 5: Receipt Verification (Prove Persistence)
    
    Agent->>Agent: Compute local SHA256<br/>hash = SHA256(envelope_bytes)
    Agent->>CMD: verify_receipt(hash, position=88)
    activate CMD
    
    CMD->>K0_CMD: POST /k0/command.verify_receipt<br/>Body: {receipt: hash, position: 88}
    activate K0_CMD
    
    K0_CMD->>IDX: Lookup receipt in index
    activate IDX
    IDX->>IDX: SELECT position FROM receipt_index WHERE hash = ?
    
    alt Receipt found at position 88
        IDX-->>K0_CMD: Found at position 88
        K0_CMD-->>CMD: 200 OK<br/>{verified: true, position: 88}
    else Receipt not found
        IDX-->>K0_CMD: Not found
        K0_CMD-->>CMD: 404 Not Found<br/>{verified: false}
    end
    deactivate IDX
    deactivate K0_CMD
    
    CMD-->>Agent: ReceiptVerification (verified=True, position=88)
    deactivate CMD
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Phase 6: WAL Lag Monitoring
    
    loop Every 5 seconds
        Agent->>QRY: get_wal_position()
        activate QRY
        
        QRY->>K0_QRY: GET /k0/query.wal_position
        activate K0_QRY
        
        K0_QRY->>WAL: SELECT MAX(position) FROM wal
        activate WAL
        WAL-->>K0_QRY: Current position: 92
        deactivate WAL
        
        K0_QRY->>K0_QRY: Compute lag<br/>lag_ms = now() - last_write_timestamp
        K0_QRY-->>QRY: 200 OK<br/>{position: 92, lag_ms: 45}
        deactivate K0_QRY
        
        QRY-->>Agent: WALStatus (position=92, lag=45ms)
        deactivate QRY
        
        Agent->>Agent: Check health<br/>if lag_ms > 2000: ALERT
    end
    
    Note over Agent,SIG: Data Persistence Guarantees
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of WAL: Durability:<br/>1. SQLite WAL mode (FSYNC=FULL)<br/>2. Atomic writes (BEGIN IMMEDIATE)<br/>3. Receipt index integrity<br/>4. Crash recovery to last commit
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of IDX: Idempotency:<br/>1. SHA256 receipt as unique key<br/>2. Duplicate detection via index<br/>3. 409 Conflict for duplicates<br/>4. Original position returned
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note right of SIG: Authenticity:<br/>1. Ed25519 signature per envelope<br/>2. Public key verification<br/>3. Tamper detection<br/>4. Non-repudiation
    end
